codex
The request now gets a monotonically increasing identity, and each completion checks that identity plus the dialog’s current site/open state before changing results, loading state, or showing an error. Clearing and dialog resets invalidate pending identities; a new search also clears old hits while it runs. I’m doing a diff hygiene check only.
